      "id": "f-instance-data-manager",
      "name": "FInstanceDataManager",
      "category": "InstanceDataManager",
      "signature": "FInstanceDataManager(In Primitive Component)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "In Primitive Component",
          "type": "UPrimitiveComponent*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "public :",
      "docs": "Manager class that tracks changes to instance data within the component, and is responsible for dispatching updates of the proxy.\nTracks instance index changes to be able to maintain a persistent ID mapping for use on the render thread.\nThe ID mapping is not serialized and will be reset when the proxy is recreated.\nNot responsible for storing the component representation of the instance data.\nNOTE/TODO: This is tied to the ISM use-case, mostly because of legacy (HISM) interactions. Will be refactored and sub-classed or something.\nAlso: Still somewhat tied to the UComponent, which also can be refactored a bit to make it more general."
    },
    {
